BTW very few of my games (maybe 25% now) fail in the protection run.
By the time I've cleaned out the upper dungeon shops, tried on armor,
buffed the pet, and enter the mines, it's rare not to get to the
priest(ess) and get the AC points. It's not an unsuccessful early
strategy. Truthfully I lose the pet on these runs more than I lose
the character. Watch captians are no fun.

